 "title": "Welcome to Osage County,MO",
 "text": "Welcome to Osage County,MO\nGO\nSearch\nHome\nCounty Offices\n911/Emergency Management\nCircuit Clerk\nCounty Clerk\nCollector of Revenue\nCounty Assessor\nCounty Commission\nCounty Coroner\nCounty Health Department\nCounty Recorder\nCounty Sheriff\nCounty Surveyor\nCounty Treasurer\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRoad and Bridge Department\nUniversity of Missouri Extension\nResidents\nChurches\nLibrary\nParks & Recreation\nCounty Schools\nTowns in Osage County\nVoter Registration\nWeather\nCemetery Information\nVisitors\nAccommodations\nDining\nOsage County Historical Society\nUpcoming Events\nVisit Osage County\nCounty Resources\nAmeren Missouri\nLicense DMV\nMissouri Association of Counties (MAC)\nMissouri Court Case\nMissouri Ethics Commission\nMissouri Revised Statutes\nMO Attorney General\nMO Dept. of Natural Resources (DNR)\nMO Secretary of State\nMO State Highway Patrol (MSHP)\nPay Taxes Online\nState Historic Preservation Office (SHPO)\nSunshine Law Request Form\nThree Rivers Electric\nHow Do I\nContact Us\nPay Taxes Online\nCommission Meeting Minutes & Agenda\nView a Map of Osage County\nCounty Treasurer\nCounty Treasurer\nSub Menu\nRelated\nPages\nHome › County Offices › County Treasurer\nThe Treasurer is the custodian of county monies.\nThe primary task is careful accounting of revenues and expenditures and allocation of each to the proper fund.\nThe Treasurer fulfills administrative and executive duties for the County and exercises oversight and caretaker roles in regard to County funds.\nThe County Treasurer strives at all times to maintain good relationships with citizens, fellow officeholders,\nemployees, and legislators. The Treasurer assists in any way feasible\nto enhance county services.\nOSAGE COUNTY TREASURER\nVALERIE PRATER\n205 E. MAIN STREET\nP.O. BOX 573\nLINN, MO 65051\n(573) 897-3095 – Phone\ntreasurer@osagecountymo.gov\nHours: Monday to Friday, 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. (Closed Holidays)\nLINKS:\nMissouri State Treasurer\n© 2017 Osage County,MO\n205 E. Main Street, Linn, MO 65051\nPowered By\nRevize\nLogin\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and past this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://osagecountygov.com/county_offices/county_treasurer/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
